  "mechanism": "At natural completion H=8 only use exact own-perspective X returned by last look for surviving nonterminal boards. Average original primary leaf value and a single batched 180-degree value evaluation equally. All alive candidates on same completed depth with matching rollout 0, preserve exact terminal scores; no added evaluation on incomplete primary path, single/no search, all terminal, resource denial, NaN or over deadline. Do not change private RNG, opponent prediction, candidate sampling, pruning or first path. Rollouts remain M=MMAX=1.",
  "timing": "Original 0.58 s from public entry. One single CPU core (4), source-compatible single stream and measured costs. Before assembling batch require time + 2*(base pass fixed cost + live rows * max(smoothed,last neural row cost)) + 0.030s <=0.58. Recheck after rotation and after inference; only commit finite full scores before deadline with 0.015s return reserve. Measure true full-call elapsed, return/p99 and native search depth. A native operation cannot be forcibly preempted.",
  "comparison": "Two parent and two candidate invocations for every registered root, order as listed. All four share parent warm costs measured by 3 immediately preceding native public calls, official public historical observations/commands, same local root RNG. For attributed change require identical first-path menu, depth, original values and both pre-rescore orders; both P final orders same, both C final orders same, P and C differ, both rescoring complete all finalists and their internal change equals the externally issued difference. Keep all failures and missing cases.",
  "gate": "No further development game if there are zero reproducible qualified physical-order changes across the 32 root tickets or any admitted rescore call ending over 0.58s. Report counts by map/seat and all terminal controls. Passing only makes an older-root paired official-terminal investigation admissible, not an expected win claim.",
  "data": "All four original held physical terrains and both expert seats from the same signed archive, excluding all four first-panel terrains. Fixed t 209,229,249,269 in sorted physical fingerprint / actual seat / step order. These maps were exposed in prior studies but no scores or actions inspected for selection in this new study. No new games or fresh test maps.",
